title: WenDing
oneLiner: Estimates time to the next level from your current XP pace.
icon: icon.png

---

A HUD estimates how long until you level from the experience you are gaining now. After 5 minutes with no experience, the current pace clears. A quest turn-in updates the time remaining.

`/wd` opens the panel. It shows how long each level took, and how long each 10% of that level took.
